# Deliverable 2.0 – Company Blueprint

Before we write another chapter, I want to establish the "cover page" for the whole company. This isn't marketing—it's our internal architectural map.

## Company Blueprint v1.0

### Company Purpose

> Build enterprise software that enables organisations to modernise critical database platforms with confidence through automated migration assurance, evidence-based validation and intelligent migration capabilities.

---

### Vision

Become the trusted **Migration Intelligence Platform** for enterprise modernisation.

---

### Mission

Deliver a **Migration Assurance Platform** that automates migration validation today while evolving into a complete migration intelligence ecosystem.

---

### Product Hierarchy

```
Company
        │
        ▼
Migration Intelligence Platform
        │
        ▼
Migration Assurance Platform
        │
        ▼
Platform Core
        │
        ├── Validation Engine
        ├── Workflow Engine
        ├── Rule Engine
        ├── Audit & Evidence
        └── Database Abstraction
```

This becomes our official product hierarchy.

